      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "White DK yarn, approx. 33 g. Yellow DK yarn, approx. 6 g. Orange DK yarn, approx. 2 g. 3.5 mm crochet hook. Tapestry needle. Craft scissors. Soft measuring tape. Pair of 9 mm "
